        "template--18000004710681__d984658c-0c63-49df-9949-2b880383b327-167723086260cd9487-0": {
          "type": "ap-imagetextblock",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/3.png",
            "heading_1": "OUR ROOTS: PRIDE WITH A PURPOSE",
            "heading1_size": "",
            "heading_2": "Turning Local Loyalty into Neighborhood Progress",
            "heading2_size": 3,
            "text": "<p>For too long, the symbols of our city have been sold to the highest bidder. Every \"Chicago\" shirt bought at a tourist shop sends local capital out of state, leaving the actual blocks that build our city’s identity with nothing to show for it.</p><p><strong>My City Stands Together (MCST)</strong> was founded to change the math. We aren't a typical apparel brand; we are a community-led movement that believes pride should be productive. We believe that if you’re going to wear the flag, that flag should do something for the people living under it. We’re starting here in Chicago to prove that when a city stands as one, it can fund its own future.</p>",
            "navigation_text": ""
          }
        }
      },
