        "heading_t34BTX": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Talk about your brand</p>",
            "heading_size": "heading--small"
          }
        },
        "text_M4V4DT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We don’t believe in waste, and we don't believe in boardroom guesses. Our model is built on \"Gritty Authenticity\" and sustainable practices.</p><ul><li><strong>- Zero Waste Production:</strong> Every piece of gear is made specifically for you. By using a \"Made to Order\" system, we eliminate the environmental and financial cost of unsold inventory, ensuring more of your purchase goes exactly where it’s needed.</li><li><strong>- Premium Quality:</strong> We don't do - souvenir-shop quality. Our gear is heavyweight and durable, designed to handle the grit of city life while serving as a walking billboard for civic progress.</li><li><strong>- Direct Impact:</strong> We are currently in our foundational phase, vetting local partners like the Greater Chicago Food Depository and StreetWise. When you buy from us, you aren’t just buying a hoodie; you’re investing in the mission to keep our city's capital on our city's streets.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
